
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Cybersecurity Basics</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#101827;color:#edf4ff;padding:25px}
header{text-align:center;padding:35px 15px;background:#1c2c47;border-radius:20px}
header h1{color:#64f5c2}
main{max-width:950px;margin:25px auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:18px}
.card{background:#1c2c47;padding:22px;border-radius:15px;border:1px solid #354967}
.card h2{color:#64f5c2}
.icon{font-size:35px}
footer{text-align:center;color:#b8c9e3;padding:20px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>🔐 Cybersecurity Basics</h1>
<p>Learn how to protect computers, accounts and information.</p>
</header>
<main>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">🔑</div><h2>Strong Passwords</h2><p>Use long, unique passwords for different accounts. A password manager can help.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">🎣</div><h2>Phishing Awareness</h2><p>Check unexpected messages, links and requests for personal information carefully.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">🛡️</div><h2>Antivirus Protection</h2><p>Use trusted security software and keep it updated when appropriate.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">🔄</div><h2>Software Updates</h2><p>Updates often fix security weaknesses and improve reliability.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">📶</div><h2>Secure Wi-Fi</h2><p>Use protected networks and avoid sensitive activities on untrusted connections.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">🔒</div><h2>Privacy</h2><p>Share only necessary personal information and review app permissions.</p></article>
</main>
<footer>Think before you click. Stay safe online! 💚</footer>
</body>
</html>
